flowchart TD
  SIG[Application Signals / OTel traces / CloudWatch metrics / Synthetics] --> TRIAGE{Triage customer impact and financial risk}
  TRIAGE -->|No current impact| SEV4[SEV4 ticket / planned work]
  TRIAGE -->|Limited or intermittent impact| SEV3[SEV3 owning service team]
  TRIAGE -->|Significant impact / workaround| SEV2[SEV2 coordinated response]
  TRIAGE -->|Widespread journey failure / financial-integrity risk| SEV1[SEV1 immediate IC and bridge]
  SEV1 --> BRIDGE[Open bridge + incident record]
  SEV2 --> BRIDGE
  BRIDGE --> ROLES[IC assigns Operations or Technical Support recorder]
  ROLES --> OWNERS[Identify affected journey owner and service/provider on-call owners]
  OWNERS --> EVID[Capture lightweight evidence<br/>Aurora, MSK, ARC, SSM, CloudWatch, trace/request IDs]
  EVID --> DECIDE[Decision log<br/>UTC, evidence, approver, action owner, rollback]
  DECIDE --> ESC[Escalate immediately when triggered<br/>Recovery, Business/Risk, Security, service/provider owner]
  ESC --> MIT[Mitigate / rollback / load shed / approved DR runbook]
  ESC --> COMMS[Status updates<br/>SEV1 15m / SEV2 30m proposed targets]
  COMMS --> VERIFY{Customer impact resolved and data safe?}
  VERIFY -->|No| DECIDE
  VERIFY -->|Yes| HAND{Shift change or incident closure?}
  HAND -->|Shift change| ACCEPT[Verbal + written handover<br/>incoming IC explicitly accepts command]
  ACCEPT --> DECIDE
  HAND -->|Closure| PIR[Close after reconciliation<br/>then blameless RCA + owned actions]
